---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
---

<section class="engagement" aria-labelledby="engagement-title">
  <p class="engagement-kicker">GOOD · COMMENT · SUBSCRIBE</p>
  <h2 id="engagement-title">읽고 난 생각을<br />남겨주세요.</h2>
  <div class="engagement-actions">
    <a href="#giscus-comments">♡ 좋아요 · 댓글</a>
    <a href={`${base}rss.xml`} target="_blank" rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml">＋ 새 글 구독</a>
  </div>
  <p class="engagement-note">좋아요와 댓글은 GitHub 로그인 후 남길 수 있어요. 구독은 RSS 리더에서 열립니다.</p>
  <div id="giscus-comments" class="comments">
    <script
      src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
      data-repo="discount04/portfolio_blog"
      data-repo-id="R_kgDOURSu9g"
      data-category="General"
      data-category-id="DIC_kwDOURSu9s4DFFH6"
      data-mapping="pathname"
      data-strict="1"
      data-reactions-enabled="1"
      data-emit-metadata="0"
      data-input-position="top"
      data-theme="light"
      data-lang="ko"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      async>
    </script>
  </div>
</section>
